{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're surrounded by alien technology, and you don't know what any of it does. But if you experiment with each new object, perhaps you can figure it out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No tutorials, only carefully-crafted puzzles which guide you to the right realizations without spelling out the answer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore the world and find all 100 levels, you'll have fun gaining mastery over the world of Blackshift.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then, why not take to the Level Pit, where you can play over a thousand user-made levels, and unleash your own creations on the world?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/741110/extras/0a3e2be9edd9bdbe06dd6533a33d1085.avif?t=1754051298\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"0f4e2d182b36a16693b130de02211d5a9e30b388.jpg","localized_name":"One Down","name":"One Down","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/741110/0f4e2d182b36a16693b130de02211d5a9e30b388.jpg"},{"icon":"a6bc9d01dd4b07668482c1f6ade69502efa501fd.jpg","localized_name":"Death Win","name":"Death Win","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/741110/a6bc9d01dd4b07668482c1f6ade69502efa501fd.jpg"},{"icon":"067eb31f8b0acfa01c1bdb38f4a28964925cf505.jpg","localized_name":"Grilled!","name":"Grilled!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/741110/067eb31f8b0acfa01c1bdb38f4a28964925cf505.jpg"},{"icon":"2fad9ec892d459f847d308438e8552d7f2a39099.jpg","localized_name":"Contrarian","name":"Contrarian","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/741110/2fad9ec892d459f847d308438e8552d7f2a39099.jpg"},{"icon":"4ebec29d055a2a613e74c